      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "初夏的风吹拂得令人心旷神怡。\n我深深期盼这阵风能够推动她向前进。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "4518f3c91e60d996c478a7fe3d84a853b6dd2846d630be81a38c9b90774b6340",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
